{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"f02db4e4eba94f456c4f0f5562aabd9f5974a08a9c98d03fcd020a1c2d4289da","ja":"ふたりでお片付け！","zh":"两个人一起收拾！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ca6b3d2c4add6f67ec7cd2dd964c235545eba48f57634a7fb642131e319d3595","ja":"あ、瑞希ちゃんおはよう。\nこれからお仕事？","zh":"啊，小瑞希早上好。\n接下来有工作吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fb693f018b15ec8267ee4be564d4db117ee858ffe6d4d72434644a53371bf225","ja":"いえ、今日はオフです。なので、忙しそうだった\n青羽さんの代わりに、備品の整理をしようかと。","zh":"不，今天我休息。所以看到青羽小姐\n好像很忙，就想替她整理一下备用品。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d831de26a626c19c176931788d56e0f8a9178e15bddad59a77137b25a7f85aca","ja":"えっ、ひとりで？\n備品って、結構、量あるよね？","zh":"诶，一个人吗？\n备用品的数量还挺多的吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"76db30e8054f61df33cf278497725342dd547f81007e87dd5bf5735eeb4725c0","ja":"よかったら、私もお手伝いしようか？\n今日は、雑誌のアンケートを出すだけだったから。","zh":"如果可以的话，我也来帮忙吧？\n我今天只要寄出杂志的调查问卷就行了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d54462a5a2b8f6c9ae72fcb5f6f3cf338855b429dba5500c4b31f770a263ae1a","ja":"いいのですか？　ありがとうございます。\nでは、さっそく行きましょう。","zh":"可以吗？非常感谢。\n那么，我们这就出发吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"afc1007d92640d8d6f937e9659f32bfc21920e72ee2ffaaabaa71c807d286c16","ja":"『秋冬用』と書かれた段ボールは後ろに下げて、\n『春夏用』の段ボールを前に持ってくるそうです。","zh":"说是要把写着“秋冬用”的纸箱挪到后面，\n把“春夏用”的纸箱搬到前面来。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5ffcb450e4ae61f48fce486f7e9e64ba12d02541eb5dd72eae23690fbb9e0325","ja":"あと、出しっぱなしになっている物を、\nラベルに合わせて、しまってほしいとのことでした。","zh":"还有就是，对方希望我们把一直拿在外面没收起来的东西，\n按照标签收纳好。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"8d0d2fc4fd24b65d66e9a0827a707a651cf0c222c475c3275d82bd56aa304034","ja":"それにしても、思った以上に多いですね。\n……萩原さんが来てくれて助かったぞ。","zh":"不过，比预想的还要多呢。\n……多亏萩原过来了，帮了大忙啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"191da555f118db1dbedcab3106925506e300382adff122a75512f582f5e5a705","ja":"えへへ。\nそれじゃあ、端っこから一緒に運んでいこっか？","zh":"嘿嘿。\n那我们就从边上一起搬过去吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ac07da99fccf91d03cd17edc1bc781f5c36cbcdbd4779e657787531be65f637e","ja":"いえ、せっかく萩原さんが来てくれたので……\nどちらが速く片付けられるか、勝負しましょう。","zh":"不，萩原小姐难得过来一趟……\n不如我们来比比看，谁收拾得更快吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1600.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"759d515f69872810d8ab9674ec46a8ff8e1bdd410b65ee7eca803cc1b221525b","ja":"……えっ、勝負！？","zh":"……诶，决胜负！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
